{"speciesId":707,"names":{"fr":"Trousselin","es":"Klefki","en":"Klefki","ja":"クレッフィ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Ce Pokémon collectionne les clés qu’il agite devant ses ennemis pour les intimider."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Tiene el hábito de coleccionar llaves. Cuando un enemigo lo ataca, las hace tintinear como método de intimidación."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"These key collectors threaten any attackers by fiercely jingling their keys at them."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"カギを 集める 習性。 敵に 襲われると ジャラジャラと カギを 打ち鳴らして 威嚇する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Comme il ne se sépare jamais d’une clé qu’il trouve à son goût, les gens lui confient celle de leurs coffres, afin d’éviter de se faire voler."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Como no se separa de las llaves que le gustan bajo ningún concepto, la gente le encomienda las llaves de cajas fuertes para prevenir posibles robos."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It never lets go of a key that it likes, so people give it the keys to vaults and safes as a way to prevent crime."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"気に入った カギは 絶対に 手放さないので 防犯のために 金庫の カギを 持たせるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Ce Pokémon collectionne les clés qu’il agite devant ses ennemis pour les intimider."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Tiene el hábito de coleccionar llaves. Cuando un enemigo lo ataca, las hace tintinear como método de intimidación."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"These key collectors threaten any attackers by fiercely jingling their keys at them."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"カギを 集める 習性。 敵に 襲われると ジャラジャラと カギを 打ち鳴らして 威嚇する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Comme il ne se sépare jamais d’une clé qu’il trouve à son goût, les gens lui confient celle de leurs coffres, afin d’éviter de se faire voler."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Como no se separa de las llaves que le gustan bajo ningún concepto, la gente le encomienda las llaves de cajas fuertes para prevenir posibles robos."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"It never lets go of a key that it likes, so people give it the keys to vaults and safes as a way to prevent crime."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"気に入った カギは 絶対に 手放さないので 防犯のために 金庫の カギを 持たせるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Malgré son caractère paisible, ce Pokémon ne peut s’empêcher de se faufiler dans les foyers pour en voler les clés, qu’il aime collectionner."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Tiene el hábito de coleccionar llaves. Su carácter tranquilo no impide que le guste colarse en casas ajenas a robar llaves."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"This even-tempered Pokémon has a habit of collecting keys. It will sneak into people’s homes to steal their keys."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"カギを 集める 習性が ある。 穏やかな 性格だが 民家に 忍び込み カギを 盗んでいく。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Il insère l’appendice situé sur sa tête dans les interstices en métal afin d’en extraire les ions. Il collectionne les clés pour une raison inconnue."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Introduce el apéndice de su cabeza por los resquicios de los metales para absorber los iones. Por alguna razón, adora las llaves."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"It inserts its horn into chinks in metal, absorbing metal ions. For some reason, it collects keys."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"頭の角を 金属の すき間に 突っ込んで 金属イオンを 吸う。 なぜか カギを 集めている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Nul ne sait pourquoi il collectionne les clés, mais il est aux anges dès qu’on lui en donne une. Il n’accepte toutefois que les passe-partout."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Su afán por coleccionar llaves es un misterio y se alegra mucho si le regalan una, pero si esta no es una llave maestra, se le tuerce la cara."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Although it’s unclear why it collects keys, giving it a key makes Klefki very happy. However, it apparently only likes master keys."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"なぜ カギを 集めるか 不明だが あげると とても 喜ぶ。 ただし マスターキーじゃないと イヤみたい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il vivait autrefois dans les mines, mais quand les minéraux dont il se délectait se sont faits plus rares, il a migré vers les villages."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Hace tiempo solía vivir en minas, pero tras la disminución de los minerales que le servían de alimento, se trasladó a poblaciones humanas."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Long ago it lived in mines, but once the minerals that make up its diet became scarcer, Klefki began appearing in human settlements."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"昔は 鉱山に 棲んでいたが エサの 鉱物が 減ってきたので 人里に 現れるようになった。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Ce Pokémon collectionne les clés. Si on lui en confie une particulièrement importante, il la protègera coûte que coûte."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Un Pokémon coleccionista de llaves. Si alguien le confía una muy importante, la protegerá como si le fuese la vida en ello."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"This Pokémon is constantly collecting keys. Entrust a Klefki with important keys, and the Pokémon will protect them no matter what."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"鍵を 集めつづける ポケモン。 大事な 鍵を 預けると なにが あっても 守ってくれる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il absorbe les ions métalliques avec l’appendice sur sa tête. Il paraît qu’il ressemble à une clé car il tient à imiter cet objet qu’il aime tant."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Según parece, absorbe iones metálicos por el apéndice de la cabeza para adoptar una forma similar a la de sus amadas llaves."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Klefki sucks in metal ions with the horn topping its head. It seems this Pokémon loves keys so much that its head needed to look like one, too."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"頭の先で 金属イオンを 吸い取る。 鍵に 似ているのは 好きすぎて まねているかららしい。"}],"varieties":[{"id":707,"moves":[{"name":"cut","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",4],[25,"level-up",4]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"thunder-wave","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"toxic","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"psychic","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"double-team","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"light-screen","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"reflect","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"swift","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"rest","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"substitute","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"thief","learns":[[15,"egg",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"egg",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"egg",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"egg",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"snore","learns":[[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"protect","le